[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17280.48, "timestamp": "04:48:00", "text": "路过。你好。话虽如此，我认为 是时候了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17299.59, "timestamp": "04:48:19", "text": "结尾。非常非常感谢。以及那些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17304.19, "timestamp": "04:48:24", "text": "想念我，我错过了。糟糕。呃，是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17306.628, "timestamp": "04:48:26", "text": "好的。你真的会参与到说唱中来。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17309.91, "timestamp": "04:48:29", "text": "脸。但答案仍然是“是”。呃，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17313.03, "timestamp": "04:48:33", "text": "就我短暂的直播历程而言。所以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17316.788, "timestamp": "04:48:36", "text": "那大概就是最多两个小时的直播吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17320.31, "timestamp": "04:48:40", "text": "呃，如果帖子像超最大值那样，将会是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17324.03, "timestamp": "04:48:44", "text": "硬性限制为三小时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17327.19, "timestamp": "04:48:47", "text": "猜测。哦，对了，上限是2。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17329.39, "timestamp": "04:48:49", "text": "小时。是的，我会缩短篇幅。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17332.31, "timestamp": "04:48:52", "text": "直播，但我可能会直播更多。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17335.11, "timestamp": "04:48:55", "text": "呃，当天晚些时候会在 YouTube 或 Twitch 上发布。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17338.31, "timestamp": "04:48:58", "text": "取决于我有没有空。你好"}]